{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>You shall not add to it.</b> For perhaps you will add something abominable to Him, blessed be He — just as would happen if you wished to add types of service to El, blessed be He, since sometimes the additional service may be something abominable to Him, blessed be He, such as burning of children." "<b>And you shall not diminish from it.</b> Even when the reason for the commandment seems dispensable in your eyes, as in Solomon's saying: אֲנִי אַרְבֶּה וְלֹא אָסוּר (Proverbs 30:8 — 'Give me neither poverty nor riches')."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:19.563017705Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}